#Chunking Algorithm
1. Get the document text.
2. If there is no text, return an empty list.
3. Get chunk size and overlap configuration.
4. Start at position 0.
5. Take chunkSize characters.
6. Save that chunk.
7. Move backwards by overlap characters.
8. Start the next chunk there.
9. Repeat until the end of the document.
10. Return all chunks.